  <section class="landing-principles" aria-label="Runtime principles">
    <article>
      <span>01</span>
      <h2>Durable by default</h2>
      <p>Runs, decisions, approvals, and recovery remain visible long after a process exits.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>02</span>
      <h2>Least privilege</h2>
      <p>Agents begin read-only. Every consequential action passes through explicit policy.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>03</span>
      <h2>Evidence over magic</h2>
